# What: Files Git must not track in the multitenant sample: dependencies, build output, archives,
#     credentials and the per-tenant SQLite databases (db-t0.sqlite, db-t1.sqlite, ... and WAL files).
# Why: Definition of Done [CAP-S09] - tenant databases are created by subscriptions, never committed.
# If missing or unlinked: Local tenant databases or credentials end up in Git.
node_modules/
gen/
mta_archives/
*.mtar
default-env.json
.cdsrc-private.json
.env
.env.*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
coverage/
